{"file": "D:\\SpaceBook\\_cls7_jpg\\drawing\\078.jpg", "lines": [{"text": "ΛMUNICATION", "conf": 0.831, "box": [[232, 0], [538, 18], [536, 55], [230, 37]]}, {"text": "must learn and use the specific terms related to art.", "conf": 0.937, "box": [[46, 226], [1074, 288], [1071, 337], [43, 275]]}, {"text": "First Impression", "conf": 0.903, "box": [[49, 354], [435, 373], [432, 420], [46, 400]]}, {"text": "express it. Try to record it. Keep it in mind or write it down. It is very important to", "conf": 0.932, "box": [[41, 544], [1673, 608], [1670, 667], [38, 604]]}, {"text": "opinion. However, attitude is all important. When you respond to a new art", "conf": 0.951, "box": [[40, 679], [1678, 741], [1675, 801], [37, 739]]}, {"text": "work, you should think that the artist had something to say, some reason for", "conf": 0.927, "box": [[37, 745], [1678, 804], [1675, 867], [34, 807]]}, {"text": "creating this work. It is also true that different people have different response to", "conf": 0.928, "box": [[39, 816], [1673, 874], [1671, 931], [37, 872]]}, {"text": "the same work of art. And there are no right or wrong responses... there are only", "conf": 0.942, "box": [[35, 880], [1675, 938], [1672, 1000], [32, 942]]}, {"text": "sincere or insincere responses. So whatever you think and feel about an art work", "conf": 0.942, "box": [[36, 951], [1675, 1007], [1673, 1062], [34, 1007]]}, {"text": "is correct unlessitisinsincere.", "conf": 0.898, "box": [[39, 1021], [647, 1047], [645, 1087], [38, 1061]]}, {"text": "Look at the following drawing by a student.", "conf": 0.937, "box": [[38, 1139], [896, 1173], [894, 1223], [36, 1189]]}, {"text": "ajlab.com", "conf": 0.802, "box": [[826, 1158], [1056, 1027], [1083, 1075], [853, 1205]]}, {"text": "awaz", "conf": 0.686, "box": [[590, 1310], [711, 1241], [733, 1280], [612, 1349]]}, {"text": "78", "conf": 0.667, "box": [[742, 2167], [805, 2170], [802, 2213], [740, 2210]]}, {"text": "NOTFORSALE", "conf": 0.843, "box": [[1179, 2232], [1632, 2242], [1631, 2285], [1178, 2275]]}, {"text": "ScannedwithCamScanner", "conf": 0.881, "box": [[1094, 2324], [1274, 2324], [1274, 2344], [1094, 2344]]}]}